' RapidR Studio: RapidR's IDE (docs/ide-plan.md, I1 / L-SHELL).
'
' The shell is a RapidR program on public components (the plan's §3.2,
' decision D3): the same bytecode runs on the desktop (`rapidr ide`, the
' winit host) and in the browser (ide/web/index.html, the canvas host). It
' only assembles components and wires them together; everything with
' weight is Rust inside a component (the dock manager, the editors, the
' designer, the project, the program session, the language service).
'
'   rapidr ide [file]                    desktop
'   tools/build_studio_web.sh            the web page (target/studio-web)
'
' Files:
'   decl.inc       shared state, the command table's type, declarations
'   window.inc     the main window and the command palette
'   commands.inc   the command table → menus, tool bar, palette; enabling
'   panes.inc      the dock manager's panes (the plug-in points)
'   panels.inc     the panels: tool bar, palette, project, toolbox,
'                  properties, output
'   documents.inc  documents: code, designer, outline, problems, properties
'   designer.inc   the form designer: the code it edits, its commands
'   project.inc    the project, settings
'   editor.inc     the code editor's commands, settings, typing steps
'   debug.inc      running it, debugging it: breakpoints, stepping, the
'                  Variables / Watch / Call Stack / Breakpoints panes
'   build.inc      Build (the app for this system), Reveal, the app's settings
'   settings.inc   Tools > Settings: the include folders, the AI tab
'   ai.inc         the AI assistant: its panel, the review of its changes,
'                  a new program's preview, what was sent
'   aichats.inc    its chats, kept per project: the list, edit and retry
'   aisetup.inc    Set up RAI: free on this computer, or a cloud key
'   mcp.inc        AI apps working in Studio: its MCP server, the AI Apps
'                  pane and settings page
'   prompts.inc    Save / Don't Save / Cancel before changes would be lost
'   crash.inc      RapidR's crash and hang reports: the strip after a Studio
'                  that ended unexpectedly, a program RapidR stopped, the
'                  hang watchdog
'   safety.inc     Studio keeps your work: an error in Studio's own code
'                  said (never the end of Studio), copies of unsaved work,
'                  Restore at the next start
'   schoollock.inc School Lock: Studio's AI turned off behind a password
'                  (a teacher's, or the computer's policy)
'   chrome.inc     the look in the current theme, the status bar
'   preview.inc    "Preview in Classic": Run and the designer in RapidQ's look
'   search.inc     Find in Files (Ctrl+Shift+F), the Help pane (F1)
'   versions.inc   Versions: the pane, Save a Version, What Changed, Go
'                  Back, Undo, the local history, the change marks, badges
'   external.inc   files changed outside Studio: loaded again, or asked
'                  about; Save never overwrites newer content silently
'   workspace.inc  documents as tabs: Design | Code, split groups, the
'                  layout and open files kept
'   markdown.inc   .md files formatted: Preview | Source, links, outline
'   shell.inc      RunCommand, the events, start-up

$INCLUDE "decl.inc"
$INCLUDE "preview.inc"
$INCLUDE "window.inc"
$INCLUDE "commands.inc"
$INCLUDE "panes.inc"
$INCLUDE "panels.inc"
$INCLUDE "documents.inc"
$INCLUDE "designer.inc"
$INCLUDE "project.inc"
$INCLUDE "editor.inc"
$INCLUDE "debug.inc"
$INCLUDE "build.inc"
$INCLUDE "settings.inc"
$INCLUDE "ai.inc"
$INCLUDE "aichats.inc"
$INCLUDE "aisetup.inc"
$INCLUDE "aicoach.inc"
$INCLUDE "mcp.inc"
$INCLUDE "prompts.inc"
$INCLUDE "safety.inc"
$INCLUDE "consent.inc"
$INCLUDE "crash.inc"
$INCLUDE "schoollock.inc"
$INCLUDE "chrome.inc"
$INCLUDE "search.inc"
$INCLUDE "versions.inc"
$INCLUDE "external.inc"
$INCLUDE "workspace.inc"
$INCLUDE "markdown.inc"
$INCLUDE "demo.inc"
$INCLUDE "shell.inc"

StartStudio
Studio.ShowModal
